      "facts": [
        "A login attempt has begun. This is the top of the login sub-funnel; the gap between this and a successful `cli.login` is where users are lost.",
        "Login funnel, the path between launch and a successful `cli.login`. Emitted from login-flow.ts (the chokepoint both the modal and the `login` command share); all tagged with `via` (modal | plain_command)."
      ],
      "title": "CLI update: use-fetch-login-url",
      "summary": "CLI, Shared/Core changes across 6 file(s) (+226/−54).",
      "tags": [
        "cli"
      ],
