        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "CLI model selector keyboard navigation extends to referral banner",
        "summary": "Added `freebuff-landing-focus-store.ts` to bridge keyboard focus between the model selector and the referral banner. The selector's arrow navigation now includes banner buttons (copy invite link, use GLM) via shared state, allowing users to tab/arrow into these controls from the model list. Copy logic was refactored into `useCopyToClipboard` hook in `copy-button.tsx` to support firing actions from keyboard navigation outside the button component. Banner focus targets are appended to `navIds` in `freebuff-model-selector.tsx`, with stale cursor clearing on unmount.",
        "significance": "notable",
