        "title": "Add suggestfollowups to base-chat agent",
        "summary": "The suggest_followups tool is added to the toolNames array in agents/base-chat.ts. The system prompt instructs the agent to call this tool last, providing three specific follow-up questions with short labels and full first-person prompts. This change applies to the Freebuff Chat agent definition, enhancing post-response interaction guidance.",
